        "TileImage": "$($repository fd60e737-5448-4805-8371-cb0f936731d0).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. Your target is Eric Hebert, AKA the Sommelier. According to a generous tip Eric has been snooping around ICA pre-redaction files, and is planning on blackmailing us. Let us make sure he isn&apos;t able to do so. His personal bodyguards are also aware of his plans and our files, make sure they keep their mouth shut.\rI shall leave you to prepare, happy hunting 47.",
